--cpp11
^\[main\.assertion\.1\] line \d+ complete object: V constructed once: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.2\] line \d+ complete object: target ran: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.3\] line \d+ base subobject: one more V: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.4\] line \d+ base subobject: target ran: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.5\] line \d+ WRONG \(must FAIL\): FAILURE$
