^warning: ignoring
--
N5008 [class.base.init]/6-7: the target of a delegating constructor gets
the delegating constructor's hidden most-derived flag, not false as for a
base subobject; it used to skip the virtual bases' construction and read
their offset through vtable pointers not yet installed.
